# Growcord BOOKS — standalone accounting product build (ADR-002).
# Deploy this build at its own domain (e.g. books.growcord.in / books.<store>.com).
# The same admin codebase + VITE_PRODUCT=books = a sellable, Books-only app.
#
# Copy to `.env.production` (or set these in Coolify env) for the Books deployment.

VITE_PRODUCT=books

# Point at the tenant/platform accounting API (same backend as the suite admin).
VITE_API_SERVER_URL=https://api.homeomead.us
VITE_API_KEY=

# Notes:
# - The backend module registry must grant the tenant the 'accounting' module
#   (and 'subscriptions'/'einvoicing' if sold) — the UI scoping here lines up with it.
# - Users log in with their normal credentials; a Books deployment simply shows
#   only the Accounting (Books) workspace and lands on /panel/accounting.
# - To mint another product app: set VITE_PRODUCT=commerce|marketing|inventory|seo
#   and deploy at that product's domain (see admin/src/lib/product.ts).
